  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：全球主题，中国模型市场定价与开放权重采用</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">过去一周，全球开放权重模型领域出现了三个值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的变化：中国模型开始调整定价、美国企业采用开放权重模型的数据点增多、Meta 重新进入开放权重领域。MS在最新一期全球主题研究报告中提出一个核心判断：世界正在走向多模型并存，开放权重模型正在为企业带来实际回报，而中美模型定价差异将成为影响这一进程的关键变量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXcUUjQAgsSYq4tddSYR6OlBjZ5Z1Sm2nbb0suO1F1kB6RJ65uVYQrNlRypEamp9pCqvt61tDDib4J7AoDicRwUibicEcxIYWq5iark/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV9sQzyNGFYRu76lmt6hTWGLkD8EJgW57LibicbY3eXJbyfII8ibZicGNvNsCvOJZbGq80YsX3sTKHccqEvITjuGoic6SoXibm1IGu28/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVQqU8OIVwYS9picKJYicwictHseXSABnnCAibsFiaeqOHjH0NGfpf6JjLpxrdDzBCBJLOjwJjsUWHpZYxvcs9XSOdYe8eXJJYEjeibQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfbRtdprIJNiaq0wF02ea4FoI8CK6tTprKYNJlOLlbgW5NlXvibdE42h9KkQ8L3Qic6wnRiaWQH9aXJIXibAiaomqbibnB1BSdN224Wc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 51-MS-Global Thematics The Model Race Gets More Complicated Chinese Model Pricing - Open-Weights Adoption-260812</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
